<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>The Ultimate AI Money Stack — Make Money With AI in Nigeria</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Syne:wght@400;600;700;800&family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
  :root {
    --gold: #F5A623;
    --gold-dim: #c8851a;
    --red: #E94560;
    --dark: #080810;
    --dark2: #0f0f1a;
    --card: #12121f;
    --card2: #1a1a2e;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --gray: #a0a0b8;
    --green: #00e676;
    --purple: #7c4dff;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    cursor: default;
  }

  /* ── NOISE OVERLAY ── */
  body::before {
    content: '';
    position: fixed; inset: 0;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='n'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='4' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.04'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
    pointer-events: none; z-index: 999; opacity: .5;
  }

  /* ── FLOATING NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px 40px;
    background: rgba(8,8,16,.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.15);
  }
  .nav-logo {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--gold);
  }
  .nav-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #000;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px;
    padding: 10px 22px; border-radius: 4px;
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: .5px;
    transition: transform .2s, background .2s;
  }
  .nav-btn:hover { background: #ffc340; transform: translateY(-1px); }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 120px 24px 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* animated grid bg */
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(245,166,35,.06) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(245,166,35,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    animation: gridMove 20s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes gridMove { to { background-position: 60px 60px; } }

  /* radial glow */
  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 50% 50%, rgba(233,69,96,.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: rgba(233,69,96,.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,.4);
    color: var(--red);
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    animation: fadeUp .8s ease both;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 10vw, 110px);
    line-height: .92;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    animation: fadeUp .8s .1s ease both;
  }
  .hero h1 span { color: var(--gold); }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 20px);
    color: var(--gray);
    font-weight: 300; max-width: 640px;
    line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 48px;
    animation: fadeUp .8s .2s ease both;
  }
  .hero-sub strong { color: var(--white); font-weight: 500; }

  .hero-cta-wrap {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
    animation: fadeUp .8s .3s ease both;
  }

  .cta-main {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #000;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 17px;
    padding: 18px 42px; border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: .3px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(245,166,35,.35);
    transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-main::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.25) 50%, transparent 70%);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform .5s;
  }
  .cta-main:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }
  .cta-main:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 50px rgba(245,166,35,.5); }

  .cta-note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); }
  .cta-note span { color: var(--green); font-weight: 500; }

  /* ── STATS BAR ── */
  .stats {
    display: flex; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto; max-width: 900px; padding: 0 24px;
    animation: fadeUp .8s .4s ease both;
  }
  .stat-item {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.12);
    flex: 1; min-width: 160px;
    padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center;
  }
  .stat-item:first-child { border-radius: 8px 0 0 8px; }
  .stat-item:last-child  { border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 48px; color: var(--gold); line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; }

  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  /* ── SECTION SHARED ── */
  section { padding: 100px 24px; }
  .section-inner { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .section-tag {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 6vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 1px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title span { color: var(--gold); }
  .section-body {
    font-size: 17px; color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px;
  }

  /* ── PAIN SECTION ── */
  .pain { background: var(--dark2); }
  .pain-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px; margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .pain-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,.2);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--red);
    padding: 28px 24px; border-radius: 8px;
    transition: transform .3s, border-color .3s;
  }
  .pain-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); border-color: var(--red); }
  .pain-icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .pain-title { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .pain-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ── WHAT'S INSIDE ── */
  .inside-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .cat-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.1);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 28px;
    transition: transform .3s, border-color .3s, box-shadow .3s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cat-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--red));
  }
  .cat-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(245,166,35,.35);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
  }
  .cat-icon { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cat-name {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .cat-desc { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .tool-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .tool-pill {
    background: rgba(245,166,35,.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.2);
    color: var(--gold); font-size: 11px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;
    letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
  .steps-badge {
    margin-top: 16px;
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    background: rgba(0,230,118,.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,.2);
    color: var(--green); font-size: 12px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    padding: 5px 12px; border-radius: 4px;
  }

  /* ── PROOF / WHAT YOU GET ── */
  .proof { background: var(--dark2); }
  .proof-list {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
  }
  .proof-item {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 20px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.1);
    border-radius: 10px; padding: 24px 28px;
    transition: border-color .3s;
  }
  .proof-item:hover { border-color: rgba(245,166,35,.3); }
  .proof-num {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 42px; color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1; min-width: 44px;
  }
  .proof-text h4 {
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px; margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .proof-text p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ── TESTIMONIALS ── */
  .testi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px; margin-top: 56px;
  }
  .testi-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.1);
    border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 28px;
    position: relative;
    transition: transform .3s;
  }
  .testi-card:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
  .testi-quote {
    font-size: 48px; color: var(--gold);
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    line-height: .8; margin-bottom: 16px;
    opacity: .5;
  }
  .testi-text {
    font-size: 15px; color: var(--white);
    line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .testi-author {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
  }
  .testi-avatar {
    width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), var(--red));
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 16px; color: #000;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .testi-name { font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }
  .testi-role { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); }
  .testi-stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }

  /* ── PRICING ── */
  .pricing { background: var(--dark2); text-align: center; }
  .price-card {
    max-width: 520px; margin: 56px auto 0;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 2px solid var(--gold);
    border-radius: 16px; padding: 52px 40px;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(245,166,35,.15);
  }
  .price-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--red), var(--gold));
    background-size: 200%;
    animation: shimmer 3s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes shimmer { to { background-position: 200% center; } }

  .price-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--white); font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .price-old {
    font-size: 20px; color: var(--gray);
    text-decoration: line-through; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .price-new {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 80px; color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1; margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .price-currency { font-size: 32px; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1.8; }
  .price-note { font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); margin-bottom: 36px; }

  .price-features {
    list-style: none; text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 40px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;
  }
  .price-features li {
    display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px;
    font-size: 15px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .price-features li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--green); font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px;
  }
  .price-features li strong { color: var(--white); }

  .cta-big {
    display: block; width: 100%;
    background: var(--gold); color: #000;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 18px;
    padding: 20px 24px; border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none; text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: .3px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(245,166,35,.4);
    transition: transform .25s, box-shadow .25s, background .25s;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-big::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, transparent 30%, rgba(255,255,255,.3) 50%, transparent 70%);
    transform: translateX(-100%);
    transition: transform .5s;
  }
  .cta-big:hover::before { transform: translateX(100%); }
  .cta-big:hover { background: #ffc340; transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 60px rgba(245,166,35,.55); }

  .guarantee {
    margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;
  }

  /* ── FAQ ── */
  .faq-list { margin-top: 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .faq-item {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.1);
    border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .faq-q {
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer;
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    transition: color .2s;
    user-select: none;
  }
  .faq-q:hover { color: var(--gold); }
  .faq-icon {
    font-size: 20px; color: var(--gold);
    transition: transform .3s; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .faq-a {
    max-height: 0; overflow: hidden;
    transition: max-height .4s ease, padding .3s;
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .faq-item.open .faq-a { max-height: 200px; padding: 0 24px 20px; }
  .faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }

  /* ── FINAL CTA ── */
  .final-cta {
    text-align: center; padding: 120px 24px;
    background: var(--dark2);
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .final-cta::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
  }
  .final-cta .section-title { font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px); }

  /* ── FLOATING BUTTON ── */
  .float-btn {
    position: fixed; bottom: 28px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    z-index: 200;
    background: var(--gold); color: #000;
    font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;
    padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 40px rgba(245,166,35,.5);
    animation: floatPop 1s 2s ease both, floatBounce 3s 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    letter-spacing: .3px;
  }
  @keyframes floatPop {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(20px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
  }
  @keyframes floatBounce {
    0%,100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
    50%      { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-5px); }
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    background: var(--dark); border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    padding: 40px 24px; text-align: center;
  }
  footer p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.8; }

  /* ── SCROLL REVEAL ── */
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity .7s ease, transform .7s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    nav { padding: 14px 20px; }
    .nav-logo { font-size: 18px; }
    .stat-item:first-child, .stat-item:last-child { border-radius: 0; }
    .price-card { padding: 36px 24px; }
    .price-new { font-size: 64px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">AI MONEY STACK</div>
  <a href="https://flutterwave.com/pay/gzqb2usfhvgq" class="nav-btn" target="_blank">⬇ Get It Now</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-tag">🇳🇬 Made For Nigerians</div>
  <h1>THE <span>AI TOOLS</span><br/>THAT PAY</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    <strong>25 AI tools.</strong> 125 beginner steps. One guide that shows you exactly how to turn free AI into
    <strong>real Naira — starting this week.</strong>
  </p>
  <div class="hero-cta-wrap">
    <a href="https://flutterwave.com/pay/gzqb2usfhvgq" class="cta-main" target="_blank">
      ⬇️ Download The AI Money Stack
    </a>
    <p class="cta-note">One-time payment · <span>Pay → DM us on WhatsApp → Get your PDF instantly</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats reveal">
  <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">25+</div><div class="stat-label">AI Tools Inside</div></div>
  <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">125</div><div class="stat-label">Beginner Steps</div></div>
  <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">5</div><div class="stat-label">Income Categories</div></div>
  <div class="stat-item"><div class="stat-num">₦0</div><div class="stat-label">Cost To Start</div></div>
</div>

<!-- PAIN -->
<section class="pain">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-tag">Sound Familiar?</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">YOU'VE HEARD ABOUT <span>AI MONEY</span><br/>BUT NOBODY SHOWS YOU HOW</h2>
      <p class="section-body">Every day you see people talking about making money with AI — but no one explains the exact steps. That ends today.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pain-grid">
      <div class="pain-card reveal">
        <div class="pain-icon">😤</div>
        <div class="pain-title">You see people earning with AI online but don't know where to start</div>
        <div class="pain-text">The information is scattered everywhere. No clear path. No step-by-step guide built for Nigeria.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card reveal">
        <div class="pain-icon">💸</div>
        <div class="pain-title">You're worried you need to spend a lot of money to begin</div>
        <div class="pain-text">Most of the 25 tools in this guide are completely free. You can start earning without spending a single Naira on tools.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card reveal">
        <div class="pain-icon">😰</div>
        <div class="pain-title">You think you need to be tech-savvy or have special skills</div>
        <div class="pain-text">If you can use WhatsApp, you can use every tool in this guide. No coding. No degree. No experience required.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pain-card reveal">
        <div class="pain-icon">⏰</div>
        <div class="pain-title">You're tired of wasting time figuring things out yourself</div>
        <div class="pain-text">This guide gives you the exact steps that work — no trial and error, no wasted hours, no confusion.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT'S INSIDE -->
<section>
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="section-tag">Inside The Guide</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">25 TOOLS ACROSS<br/><span>5 INCOME CATEGORIES</span></h2>
      <p class="section-body">Every tool comes with a 5-step beginner guide: how to sign up, how to practice, how to find clients, what to charge, and how to scale.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="inside-grid">

      <div class="cat-card reveal">
        <div class="cat-icon">✍️</div>
        <div class="cat-name">Writing & Content</div>
        <div class="cat-desc">Use AI to write blog posts, sales copy, social media captions, emails, and product descriptions for clients.</div>
        <div class="tool-list">
          <span class="tool-pill">ChatGPT</span>
          <span class="tool-pill">Claude AI</span>
